::msgcat::mcset sl "You are about to commit on a detached head. This is a potentially dangerous thing to do because if you switch to another branch you will lose your changes and it can be difficult to retrieve them later from the reflog. You should probably cancel this commit and create a new branch to continue.\n \n Do you really want to proceed with your Commit?" "Pripravljate se na potrditev na ločeni glavi. To je potencialno nevarno, saj boste ob preklopu na drugo vejo izgubili svoje spremembe, ki jih bo kasneje težko pridobiti iz refloga. Verjetno bi morali to potrditev preklicati in ustvariti novo vejo, da bi nadaljevali.\n \nAli res želite nadaljevati s potrditvijo?"
